Package: cgt.equity.sim
Title: Monte Carlo Simulation of the 2026 Budget CGT Reform
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matt", "Bowes", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mattbowes96@gmail.com")
Description: Simulates representative retail share portfolios drawn from
    the S&P/ASX 200 in 2009, 2015, and 2020 to estimate the distributional
    and revenue impact of replacing the 50% CGT discount with CPI
    indexation plus a 30% minimum tax. Not a package in the usual sense;
    the DESCRIPTION enables devtools::load_all() during development.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    arrow,
    dplyr,
    furrr,
    future,
    ggplot2,
    lubridate,
    purrr,
    readr,
    readabs,
    tibble,
    tidyquant,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    knitr,
    quarto,
    testthat
